{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2022-07-26 09:42:00', 'title': 'LMC ANNOUNCES START OF LEASING FOR RESIDENCES KIERLAND', 'text': "MID-RISE COMMUNITY FEATURES 290 APARTMENT HOMES AND TOWNHOMES IN SCOTTSDALE\xa0\xa0 SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ. , JULY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 LMC , A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LENNAR CORPORATION [NYSE: LEN] AND A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE START OF LEASING AT RESIDENCES KIERLAND, A MID-RISE SPA-CENTRIC COMMUNITY IN SCOTTSDALE'S BURGEONING KIERLAND NEIGHBORHOOD."}